flowchart TD
  A["After each result or thought"] --> B{"Repeat signal?"}
  B -- no --> A
  B -- yes --> C["STOP action"]
  C --> D["Write tried / happened / known"]
  D --> E["Name false assumption"]
  E --> F["Switch strategy"]
  F --> G{"Strategies used < 3?"}
  G -- yes --> H["Try new approach"] --> A
  G -- no --> I["Escalate to user with evidence"]
